      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "夜空に言われたんだ。\nもし、いなくなっても探さないで、って。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……夜空。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "美空にも言ってたのか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "少しだけ。\n一人になりたい時は、少し待ってって。\nでも、本当にいなくなったら探すよって言いました。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そうか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夜空、そういうこと言う時は、本当は探してほしい時もあるんです。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "わかる気がする。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "でも、追いかけすぎると逃げちゃう。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "難しいな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "はい。\n夜空は、難しいです。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "でも、大事なんだろ。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "もちろんです。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "じゃあ、探すか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……でも、少しだけ待ってもいいですか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "待つ？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夜空、本当に一人になりたい時もあるので。\n今すぐ探すと、もっと意地になっちゃうかもしれません。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "それもそうか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "まず、メッセージだけ送ってみます。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――美空はスマホを取り出し、夜空へメッセージを送る。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "『夜空、今どこ？　心配してるよ』",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――少し待つ。\nすぐには返事が来ない。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……既読、つかないです。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
