      "text": "大丈夫、って来た。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……その大丈夫は、たぶん信用しない方がいいです。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "だよな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――さらに、夜空からもう一通届く。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "『少し一人にして』",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夜空……。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "もう一通来た。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "『探さないで』",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
