    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "美空。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "まだ、待ってください。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "本当にいいのか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "よくないです。\nでも、今すぐ追いかけたら、夜空はもっと逃げると思います。",
