        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……それは、しんどいな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "はい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "美空。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "はい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "俺は、どれくらい待てばいい？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……少しだけ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "少しだけ、か。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夜空の“少し”は、長くしすぎると危ないです。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "わかった。\n少しだけ待つ。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "ありがとうございます。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――時間が過ぎる。\n売り場の時計の針が進む音が、妙にはっきり聞こえた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……十分経った。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "はい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "美空。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "もう一度、送ってみます。",
