    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――美空がメッセージを送る。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "『夜空、返事だけでいいよ。今どこ？』",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――既読はつかない。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……既読、つかないです。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "俺も送る。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "『夜空。今から探す。怒ってもいいから、無事なら返事してくれ』"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――送信。\n既読は、つかない。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "店長。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
