      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夜空？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "最終更新、夜空だ。\n十五分前。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "じゃあ、まだ店の近くにいたんですね。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そこからどこへ行ったか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夜空が一人になりたい時に行く場所……。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "心当たりは？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "いくつかあります。\nでも、夜空は見つかりにくい場所を選ぶと思います。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "駅の裏道。\nプラネタリウムの近く。\nそれから、高台の方。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "高台？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夕凪展望台。\n人が少なくて、街が見える場所です。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "わかった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "店長、わたしも――",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "美空は店にいてくれ。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "でも。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "夜空が戻ってくるかもしれない。\nその時、美空がいなかったら不安になる。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "俺が探す。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "……お願いします。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "必ず連絡する。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "はい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――美空は小さくうなずく。\nその顔は、今にも泣きそうなのに、それでも店長を信じようとしていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夜空を、お願いします。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "任せてくれ。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――店長は店を出る。\n夜の空気が冷たい。\nスマホには、夜空からの短いメッセージが残っている。\n『探さないで』"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……悪いな、夜空。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――それでも店長は、夜空を探しに行く。"
    }
